---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 图鉴
description: KUSARIUM 的插画与视觉标本。
permalink: /gallery/index.html
---
<header class="page-intro shell">
  <p class="eyebrow">ILLUSTRATED SPECIMENS</p>
  <h1>图鉴</h1>
  <p>将画面按照采集日期轻轻放好。点击任意标本，可以阅读它旁边留下的文字。</p>
</header>

<section class="gallery shell section" aria-label="插画图鉴">
  {% if collections.gallery.length %}
    <div class="gallery-grid">
      {% for post in collections.gallery %}
        <article class="gallery-item">
          <button class="gallery-item__image" type="button" data-lightbox-trigger data-src="{{ post.data.cover }}" data-alt="{{ post.data.coverAlt | default(post.data.title) }}" aria-label="放大查看：{{ post.data.title }}">
            <img src="{{ post.data.cover }}" alt="{{ post.data.coverAlt | default(post.data.title) }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <span class="gallery-item__view">VIEW</span>
          </button>
          <div class="gallery-item__caption">
            <div>
              <time datetime="{{ post.date | dateIso }}">{{ post.date | dateReadable }}</time>
              <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
            </div>
            <span>{{ loop.index | pad2 }}</span>
          </div>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  {% else %}
    <div class="empty-state">
      <span class="specimen-sprig"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b></b></span>
      <h2>图鉴还在等待第一枚标本</h2>
      <p>为文章添加 <code>cover</code> 图片后，它会自动出现在这里。</p>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>

<dialog class="lightbox" data-lightbox>
  <button class="lightbox__close" type="button" data-lightbox-close aria-label="关闭大图">×</button>
  <img src="" alt="" data-lightbox-image>
</dialog>
